Fix the following code review issues for the category management API. Work in `/Users/felix/code/.claude/worktrees/beijian+spare-parts-management/beijian/`

## Must Fix

### C1: DELETE doesn't check for child subcategories

In `src/app/api/categories/[id]/route.ts`, the DELETE handler only checks for items, not child categories. If a category has children, Prisma throws a foreign key error (500). Add a child count check:

```typescript
export async function DELETE(request: Request, { params }: { params: Promise<{ id: string }> }) {
  const { id } = await params;

  // Check for child categories
  const childCount = await prisma.category.count({ where: { parentId: id } });
  if (childCount > 0) {
    return NextResponse.json(
      { error: "该分类下存在子分类，不能删除" },
      { status: 400 }
    );
  }

  // Check for items in this category
  const itemCount = await prisma.item.count({ where: { categoryId: id } });
  if (itemCount > 0) {
    return NextResponse.json(
      { error: "该分类下存在物料，不能删除" },
      { status: 400 }
    );
  }

  await prisma.category.delete({ where: { id } });
  return NextResponse.json({ success: true });
}
```

### I1: No input validation in POST and PUT

In `src/app/api/categories/route.ts`, add name validation:
```typescript
export async function POST(request: Request) {
  const data = await request.json();

  if (!data.name || typeof data.name !== "string" || data.name.trim().length === 0) {
    return NextResponse.json({ error: "分类名称不能为空" }, { status: 400 });
  }

  const category = await prisma.category.create({
    data: {
      name: data.name.trim(),
      parentId: data.parentId || null,
      description: data.description || null,
    },
  });
  return NextResponse.json(category, { status: 201 });
}
```

In `src/app/api/categories/[id]/route.ts`, add name validation to PUT:
```typescript
export async function PUT(request: Request, { params }: { params: Promise<{ id: string }> }) {
  const { id } = await params;
  const data = await request.json();

  if (!data.name || typeof data.name !== "string" || data.name.trim().length === 0) {
    return NextResponse.json({ error: "分类名称不能为空" }, { status: 400 });
  }

  try {
    const category = await prisma.category.update({
      where: { id },
      data: {
        name: data.name.trim(),
        parentId: data.parentId || null,
        description: data.description || null,
      },
    });
    return NextResponse.json(category);
  } catch (error) {
    return NextResponse.json({ error: "分类不存在" }, { status: 404 });
  }
}
```

### I2: Add try/catch to GET (list) and DELETE as well

Wrap DELETE in try/catch to handle missing category:
```typescript
try {
  // ... checks and delete
  return NextResponse.json({ success: true });
} catch (error) {
  return NextResponse.json({ error: "分类不存在" }, { status: 404 });
}
```

Wrap GET in try/catch:
```typescript
export async function GET() {
  try {
    const categories = await prisma.category.findMany({
      include: { _count: { select: { items: true } } },
      orderBy: { name: "asc" },
    });
    return NextResponse.json(categories);
  } catch (error) {
    return NextResponse.json({ error: "获取分类列表失败" }, { status: 500 });
  }
}
```

## After Fixes

1. Run the tests: `npx vitest run tests/api/categories.test.ts`
2. Verify `npm run build` succeeds
3. Commit:

```bash
git add -A
git commit -m "fix: add validation, error handling, and child-category check to category API

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
```

Report back with status.

